{
  "scenes": [
    {
      "id": "s2_private_msg",
      "type": "Private_Unknown",
      "chat": "Private_Unknown",
      "sender": "Unknown",
      "action": "Notification",
      "text": "Well… that's convenient.",
      "next": "S2_Player_Intro"
    },
    {
      "id": "S2_Player_Intro",
      "type": "Player_Choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "text": "Who the hell are you? How did you get my number?",
          "next": "S2_Unknown_Rebuttal"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "S2_Unknown_Rebuttal",
      "type": "Chat_Event",
      "chat": "Private_Unknown",
      "sender": "Unknown",
      "action": "Typing",
      "text": "Relax. My identity is the least of your concerns right now.",
      "next": "S2_Unknown_Hook"
    },
    {
      "id": "S2_Unknown_Hook",
      "type": "Chat_Event",
      "chat": "Private_Unknown",
      "sender": "Unknown",
      "text": "You should be asking about Rebecca Stone.",
      "next": "S2_Choice_HowKnow"
    },
    {
      "id": "S2_Choice_HowKnow",
      "type": "Player_Choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "text": "How do you know her?",
          "next": "S2_Branch_A"
        },
        {
          "text": "If this is some kind of sick joke, cut it out.",
          "next": "S2_Branch_B"
        },
        {
          "text": "I'm listening. Talk.",
          "next": "S2_Branch_C"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "S2_Branch_A",
      "type": "Chat_Event",
      "sender": "Unknown",
      "action": "Typing",
      "text": "Because she actually trusted me. Unlike the people she was with.",
      "next": "S2_The_Factory_Lead"
    },
    {
      "id": "S2_Branch_B",
      "type": "Chat_Event",
      "sender": "Unknown",
      "action": "Typing",
      "text": "Look at the news, [PlayerName]. Does any of this look like a joke to you?",
      "next": "S2_The_Factory_Lead"
    },
    {
      "id": "S2_Branch_C",
      "type": "Chat_Event",
      "sender": "Unknown",
      "action": "Typing",
      "text": "Straight to the point. I like that. Pay attention.",
      "next": "S2_The_Factory_Lead"
    },
    {
      "id": "S2_The_Factory_Lead",
      "type": "Chat_Event",
      "sender": "Unknown",
      "action": "Typing",
      "text": "Rebecca didn't just vanish into thin air. She went to that factory for a reason.",
      "next": "S2_Player_PartyQuery"
    },
    {
      "id": "S2_Player_PartyQuery",
      "type": "Player_Choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "text": "The article said it was just a party.",
          "next": "S2_The_Sister_Reveal"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "S2_The_Sister_Reveal",
      "type": "Chat_Event",
      "sender": "Unknown",
      "action": "Typing",
      "text": "A party? Sure. But the press missed the best part: who organized it.",
      "next": "S2_Player_WhatMean"
    },
    {
      "id": "S2_Player_WhatMean",
      "type": "Player_Choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "text": "What are you implying?",
          "next": "S2_Amelia_Accusation"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "S2_Amelia_Accusation",
      "type": "Chat_Event",
      "sender": "Unknown",
      "action": "Typing",
      "text": "Her sister. Amelia. She hand-picked that derelict hellhole.",
      "next": "S2_Choice_AmeliaLogic"
    },
    {
      "id": "S2_Choice_AmeliaLogic",
      "type": "Player_Choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "text": "That doesn't make sense. Why would she?",
          "next": "S2_Amelia_Reasoning"
        },
        {
          "text": "How are you so sure Amelia called the shots?",
          "next": "S2_Amelia_Reasoning"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "S2_Amelia_Reasoning",
      "type": "Chat_Event",
      "sender": "Unknown",
      "action": "Typing",
      "text": "Because she handled the invites. She chose the isolation. No neighbors, no witnesses.",
      "next": "S2_Amelia_Scare"
    },
    {
      "id": "S2_Amelia_Scare",
      "type": "Chat_Event",
      "sender": "Unknown",
      "action": "Typing",
      "text": "It was supposed to be a 'scare.' A dramatic stunt for attention.",
      "next": "S2_Player_ScareGoal"
    },
    {
      "id": "S2_Player_ScareGoal",
      "type": "Player_Choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "text": "You think she staged the whole disappearance?",
          "next": "S2_The_Phone_Call"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "S2_The_Phone_Call",
      "type": "Chat_Event",
      "sender": "Unknown",
      "action": "Typing",
      "text": "That's what Rebecca told me herself.",
      "next": "S2_Choice_WhenTalk"
    },
    {
      "id": "S2_Choice_WhenTalk",
      "type": "Player_Choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "text": "She talked to you right before she vanished?",
          "next": "S2_Timeline_Details"
        },
        {
          "text": "When exactly was this?",
          "next": "S2_Timeline_Details"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "S2_Timeline_Details",
      "type": "Chat_Event",
      "sender": "Unknown",
      "action": "Typing",
      "text": "11:30 PM. She stepped outside to find a signal and called me.",
      "next": "S2_Something_Off"
    },
    {
      "id": "S2_Something_Off",
      "type": "Chat_Event",
      "sender": "Unknown",
      "action": "Typing",
      "text": "She was playing it cool, but her voice was shaking. She was in a hurry.",
      "next": "S2_The_Hangup"
    },
    {
      "id": "S2_The_Hangup",
      "type": "Chat_Event",
      "sender": "Unknown",
      "action": "Typing",
      "text": "She didn't even answer my question before hanging up. That was the last time I heard her.",
      "next": "S2_Player_Question"
    },
    {
      "id": "S2_Player_Question",
      "type": "Player_Choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "text": "What did you ask her?",
          "next": "S2_The_Last_Words"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "S2_The_Last_Words",
      "type": "Chat_Event",
      "sender": "Unknown",
      "action": "Typing",
      "text": "I asked if she was okay. She lied and said yes.",
      "next": "S2_The_Last_Words_2"
    },
    {
      "id": "S2_The_Last_Words_2",
      "type": "Chat_Event",
      "sender": "Unknown",
      "action": "Pause",
      "duration": 2000,
      "text": "I asked if Amelia had done something. She ignored me and said she'd call back.",
      "next": "S2_The_Last_Words_3"
    },
    {
      "id": "S2_The_Last_Words_3",
      "type": "Chat_Event",
      "sender": "Unknown",
      "action": "Typing",
      "text": "She never did.",
      "next": "S2_Choice_WhatSaying"
    },
    {
      "id": "S2_Choice_WhatSaying",
      "type": "Player_Choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "text": "So what are you getting at?",
          "next": "S2_The_Mismatch"
        },
        {
          "text": "What happened after she hung up?",
          "next": "S2_The_Mismatch"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "S2_The_Mismatch",
      "type": "Chat_Event",
      "sender": "Unknown",
      "action": "Typing",
      "text": "I'm saying the 'official' timeline is garbage.",
      "next": "S2_The_Coordination"
    },
    {
      "id": "S2_The_Coordination",
      "type": "Chat_Event",
      "sender": "Unknown",
      "action": "Typing",
      "text": "The group is already aligning their stories. Coordinating what to feed the police.",
      "next": "S2_Player_HowKnow"
    },
    {
      "id": "S2_Player_HowKnow",
      "type": "Player_Choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "text": "How can you possibly know that?",
          "next": "S2_The_Intercept"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "S2_The_Intercept",
      "type": "Chat_Event",
      "sender": "Unknown",
      "action": "Typing",
      "text": "Because I'm watching their private group chat right now.",
      "next": "S2_The_Intercept_2"
    },
    {
      "id": "S2_The_Intercept_2",
      "type": "Chat_Event",
      "sender": "Unknown",
      "action": "Pause",
      "duration": 1500,
      "text": "They're nervous. Their stories don't match, and they know it.",
      "next": "S2_Choice_WhatSayingGroup"
    },
    {
      "id": "S2_Choice_WhatSayingGroup",
      "type": "Player_Choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "text": "What is Amelia saying?",
          "next": "S2_Group_Intel_A"
        },
        {
          "text": "What about the others?",
          "next": "S2_Group_Intel_B"
        },
        {
          "text": "Show me exactly what they're saying.",
          "next": "S2_Group_Intel_C"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "S2_Group_Intel_A",
      "type": "Chat_Event",
      "sender": "Unknown",
      "text": "Amelia claims Rebecca left at midnight. Says she didn't see which way she went.",
      "next": "S2_The_Invitation"
    },
    {
      "id": "S2_Group_Intel_B",
      "type": "Chat_Event",
      "sender": "Unknown",
      "text": "It's a mess. Chris didn't see her leave. Abigail thought she went for air. Michael is staying silent.",
      "next": "S2_The_Invitation"
    },
    {
      "id": "S2_Group_Intel_C",
      "type": "Chat_Event",
      "sender": "Unknown",
      "text": "Amelia: Midnight. Chris: Didn't see her. Abigail: Guessed she went outside. Michael: Non-committal.",
      "next": "S2_The_Invitation"
    },
    {
      "id": "S2_The_Invitation",
      "type": "Chat_Event",
      "sender": "Unknown",
      "action": "Typing",
      "text": "They're careful, but I've found a way in. I'm adding you to the group.",
      "next": "S2_The_Warning"
    },
    {
      "id": "S2_The_Warning",
      "type": "Chat_Event",
      "sender": "Unknown",
      "action": "Pause",
      "duration": 1000,
      "text": "Don't reveal what you know. Just observe. Wait for them to slip up.",
      "next": "S2_Choice_FinalReady"
    },
    {
      "id": "S2_Choice_FinalReady",
      "type": "Player_Choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "text": "Do it. Get me in.",
          "next": "S2_Add_Success"
        },
        {
          "text": "Wait, I'm not sure about this.",
          "next": "S2_Add_Forced"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "S2_Add_Success",
      "type": "Chat_Event",
      "sender": "Unknown",
      "text": "Good. Don't say anything stupid.",
      "next": "S2_SYSTEM_ADD"
    },
    {
      "id": "S2_Add_Forced",
      "type": "Chat_Event",
      "sender": "Unknown",
      "text": "Hesitating won't save her. Every second you wait, they perfect the lie.",
      "next": "S2_SYSTEM_ADD"
    },
    {
      "id": "s2_system_add",
      "type": "S2_SYSTEM_ADD",
      "text": "You were added to Dreadmoor News.",
      "next": "s3_group_chat"
    }
  ]
}
